      <div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">The Company presently has 129 employees including the officers detailed in the information set forth under the caption &#8220;Executive Officers of the
        Company&#8221; of the 2026 Proxy Statement incorporated herein by reference.</div>

