<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;">Allowance for Funds Used During Construction</div>
</ix:nonNumeric></ix:continuation>
    <ix:continuation id="Text_453223bc921f4c5f8bd8882781bcf70899" continuedAt="Text_453223bc921f4c5f8bd8882781bcf708100"><ix:continuation id="Text_2879943045454b5ea86e88bc4b94a5e81">
<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Allowance for funds used during construction (AFUDC) represents the estimated cost of funds used for construction purposes during the period of
      construction.&#160; These costs are reflected as non-cash income during the construction period and as an addition to the cost of plant constructed.&#160; AFUDC includes the net cost of borrowed funds and a rate of return on other funds.&#160; The PPUC approved
      rate of <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PublicUtilitiesAllowanceForFundsUsedDuringConstructionRate" id="Fact_a7085d6a61604d4389a34db4d2f0b6f7" contextRef="c20250101to20251231" unitRef="U006" decimals="4" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PublicUtilitiesAllowanceForFundsUsedDuringConstructionRate" id="Fact_607c830c7cfb449a9045084be3c94ca9" contextRef="c20240101to20241231" unitRef="U006" decimals="4" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">10.04</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>% was applied for 2025
      and 2024.&#160; AFUDC is recovered through water and wastewater rates as utility plant is depreciated.</div>
</ix:continuation></ix:continuation>

