<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Under the employee stock purchase plan, all full-time employees who have been employed at least <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Fact_2e865bbb70744469865d5f616b5ce79c">ninety</span> consecutive days may purchase shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock limited to <ix:nonFraction name="yorw:MaximumPercentageOfGrossCompensationAllowedToPurchaseShares" id="Fact_774c18e611c141b3bda8d38d05f93581" contextRef="c20250101to20251231_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_EmployeeStockMember" unitRef="U006" decimals="2" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">10</ix:nonFraction>%
      of gross compensation.&#160; The purchase price is <ix:nonFraction name="yorw:PurchasePriceAsPercentageOfFairMarketValueOfCommonStock" id="Fact_5408f72aee864465b43e4e3de29a7c53" contextRef="c20250101to20251231_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_EmployeeStockMember" unitRef="U006" decimals="2" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">95</ix:nonFraction>% of the fair market value (as defined).&#160; Shares issued during 2025 and 2024 were <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesEmployeeStockPurchasePlans" id="Fact_e900d8c2b1cb49ba8b4e9bb149eab190" contextRef="c20250101to20251231_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_EmployeeStockMember" unitRef="U002" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5,625</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesEmployeeStockPurchasePlans" id="Fact_61de6d2de9fb4fc1877b92e08fd16893" contextRef="c20240101to20241231_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_EmployeeStockMember" unitRef="U002" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5,137</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.&#160; As of
      December 31, 2025, <ix:nonFraction name="yorw:NumberOfAuthorizedSharesRemainingToBeIssued" id="Fact_a318d5a4292d483a8ad0deb09eb93bd7" contextRef="c20251231_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_EmployeeStockMember" unitRef="U002" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">34,654</ix:nonFraction>
      authorized shares remain unissued under the plan.</div>
</ix:continuation>
