<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">The selected long-term rate of return on plan assets was primarily based on the asset allocation of each of the plan&#8217;s assets.&#160; Analysis of the historic
      returns of these asset classes and projections of expected future returns were considered in setting the long-term rate of return.</div>
</ix:continuation>
