</ix:continuation>
      <ix:continuation id="Text_b8a19f2e86fd48d1b46bbbb249cf771220" continuedAt="Text_b8a19f2e86fd48d1b46bbbb249cf771221">
<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">On May 6, 2024, the Board awarded stock to non-employee directors effective May 6, 2024.&#160; This stock award vested immediately.&#160; On May 6, 2024, the
        Compensation and Human Capital Committee awarded restricted stock to officers and key employees effective May 6, 2024.&#160; This stock award vests ratably over <ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Fact_b39121e80b2143bb81cafe584aa26e7a" contextRef="c20250101to20251231_AwardDateAxis_GrantedOn20240506Member_AwardTypeAxis_RestrictedStockMember_GranteeStatusAxis_ShareBasedPaymentArrangementEmployeeMember_PlanNameAxis_YorkWaterCompanyLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen">three years</ix:nonNumeric> beginning May 6, 2024, with the exception of the stock award to <ix:nonFraction name="yorw:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfKeyEmployeesReceivingAcceleratedVestingPeriod" id="Fact_2ba63cb85d9140bfaaddfcca37db1888" contextRef="c20240506to20240506" unitRef="U010" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">one</ix:nonFraction>
        key employee which vested immediately.&#160; The Board accelerated the vesting period for this restricted stock award to <ix:nonFraction name="yorw:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfRetiringOfficersReceivingAcceleratedVestingPeriod" id="Fact_993df5629e174fb78c533d0a455224c0" contextRef="c20240506to20240506" unitRef="U011" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">one</ix:nonFraction> retiring officer
        from <ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Fact_f2ec6871ef6c4a5c81c03545176e1411" contextRef="c20250101to20251231_AwardDateAxis_GrantedOn20240506Member_AwardTypeAxis_RestrictedStockMember_GranteeStatusAxis_OfficerRetiringIn2024Member_PlanNameAxis_YorkWaterCompanyLongTermIncentivePlanMember" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen">three years</ix:nonNumeric> to that officer&#8217;s 2024 retirement date, which has been fully recognized as of December 31, 2024.</div>
</ix:continuation>
      <ix:continuation id="Text_b8a19f2e86fd48d1b46bbbb249cf771221" continuedAt="Text_b8a19f2e86fd48d1b46bbbb249cf771222">
