<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">On November 25, 2024, the Board awarded stock to an officer effective January 1, 2025.&#160; This stock award vested immediately.</div>
</ix:continuation>
        <ix:continuation id="Text_b8a19f2e86fd48d1b46bbbb249cf771225" continuedAt="Text_b8a19f2e86fd48d1b46bbbb249cf771226">
