    <ix:continuation id="Text_b8a19f2e86fd48d1b46bbbb249cf771230" continuedAt="Text_b8a19f2e86fd48d1b46bbbb249cf771231">
<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">The restricted stock awards provide the grantee with the rights of a shareholder, including the right to receive dividends, subject to vesting
      restrictions, and to vote such shares, but not the right to sell or otherwise transfer the shares during the restriction period.&#160; As a result, the awards are included in common shares outstanding on the balance sheet.&#160; Restricted stock awards result
      in compensation expense valued at the fair market value of the stock on the date of the grant and are amortized ratably over the requisite service period.</div>
</ix:continuation>
