<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">The Company has a federal tax loss carryover of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLossCarryforwards" id="Fact_0a969cf516e04ac0bf0e44e19a92bf6c" contextRef="c20251231_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_DomesticCountryMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1,375</ix:nonFraction>.&#160;






          This carryover has an indefinite life.&#160; The Company has Pennsylvania tax loss carryovers of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLossCarryforwards" id="Fact_638ebf070b624acaad16923e33d1b1df" contextRef="c20251231_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_StateAndLocalJurisdictionMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">3,543</ix:nonFraction>.&#160; If not used, these carryovers will
          expire between <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Fact_2ea71e220e4a4e5a80f2b358dba4c402">2042</span> and <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Fact_d30e8f8b83de474fb1324a15430af870">2045</span>.&#160;














          The Company has contribution carryovers of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:TaxCreditCarryforwardAmount" id="Fact_8ff7fa0f0e2c40c08156ac4e7d9cac1a" contextRef="c20251231_TaxCreditCarryforwardAxis_CorporateContributionCarryoverMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="-3" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">192</ix:nonFraction>.&#160; If not used, these carryovers will expire between <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Fact_780e418423ab4720939b26febfbb0022">2027</span> and <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Fact_8dd68ab44b384681ba48c8189449c7f9">2030</span>.</div>
</ix:continuation>
